<title>FINLAND: TABLE-FINLAND BANK AUG LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.96 BLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE-FINLAND BANK AUG LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.96 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 6.96 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for August 14		   5,850</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for August	   6,546</p>
<p> Average reserves to August 11			5,788</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,963</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
